      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hipped Roof Bungalow & Agricultural Lands\nat Brackloon South, Charlestown, Co. Mayo, F12 HX44\n\nProperty Overview:\nA unique opportunity to acquire a hipped roof bungalow in need of renovation, together with two rear extensions, a number of agricultural outbuildings and a substantial agricultural landholding.\n\nSet back from the public road and approached by a lovely private laneway, the property offers excellent privacy and significant potential for those seeking a renovation project in a countryside setting.\n\nAccommodation\nThe existing accommodation comprises:\n•Four bedrooms\n•Living room with stanley range\n•Separate sitting room with dual aspect windows\n•Kitchen\n•Utility room\n•Family shower room fully tiled\n•Storage room\n•Hallway\n•Bright Entrance porch\n\nThe property benefits from septic tank & group water scheme. Electricity requires reconnection.\n.\nLand & Outbuildings\nThe house stands on approximately 10.75 acres of mixed-quality agricultural land in one lot, surrounding the residence.\n\nIn addition, the property includes three separate bog plots comprising C4.05 acres in total.\n\nA number of agricultural outbuildings are also included. These are in need of renovation but offer considerable potential for agricultural, storage or ancillary uses, subject to planning.\n\nThere is also an option to purchase an additional C8.5 acres of adjoining lands.\n\nLocation:\nThe property is located close to Charlestown and all its amenities, while also being within commuting distance of Sligo and Castlebar.\n\nThe combination of a private rural setting, substantial landholding and proximity to local services makes this an attractive proposition for those looking to create a substantial family home or rural base.\n\nRenovation & Grant Potential\nThe property has been vacant for in excess of two years, which may provide an opportunity to seek assistance under the current Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant\nSEAI energy-upgrade supports may also be available.\n\nKey Points\n•Hipped roof bungalow requiring renovation, offering excellent potential.\n•Four-bedroom accommodation\n•Two rear extensions\n•Private laneway access\n•Approx. 10.75 acres of agricultural land\n•Three additional bog plots totalling approx. 4.05 acres\n•Agricultural outbuildings in need of renovation\n•Excellent renovation potential\n•Close to Charlestown\n•Within commuting distance of Sligo and Castlebar\n•Vacant for over two years, offering potential grant opportunities\n\nViewing highly recommended and strictly by appointment.\n\n"
      },
